# Discard removes both copies and the list entry, and asks nothing more.
@recovery
@file "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD" "dear sir"
cmd Open
choose "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD"
type ", and madam"
autosave
restart
expect recover "Quill found changes to LETTER.QLD that were not saved, from 25 Nov 2026 at 2:32 PM." default Yes
answer discard
dump
restart
dump
